- **Why CI is read.** The operator pass pushes the chunk's tree and reads its run on CI's one leg, `ubuntu-latest`.
  `echo.rs` uses `O_NOFOLLOW` and `geteuid()`, Linux-only by the tree (the Windows and macOS code is out of it);
  no other leg exists, so no other reading is owed.

- Expected amendments (wrap): layout-templates §Surface: cli — contract/viola-send-output/read-back (an echo-confirmed
  local command reads back), contract/viola-send-output/unconfirmable (`/cost`, `/usage`), verify's `[NN/22]`;
  design-system §Surface: cli — contract/send-readback (the echo as a further confirmer, no new word).

- **Counts / qualifiers moved:**
  - relied capability-ledger rows 21 → 22 (`LedgerRow::ALL`, `[Self; 22]`): verify's step counter `[NN/21]` →
    `[NN/22]`, the summary `21 pass  0 fail` → `22 pass  0 fail`, `LEDGER_ROWS` / `ROW_IDS` / `STEPS_PASS`
    `[&str; 21]` → `[&str; 22]`;
  - `LOCAL_COMMANDS` 3 → 6 names; classification from exact text to by-name;
  - Run B's added pastes 6 → 7 (the probe prompt aside: five → six added framing pastes); `FRAMING_TURNS` stays 5;
  - the fixture-free verify cases' summaries: `7 pass 14 fail` → `7 pass 15 fail`, `17 pass 4 fail` →
    `18 pass 4 fail`, `19 pass 2 fail` → `19 pass 3 fail`, `18 pass 3 fail` → `18 pass 4 fail`,
    `16 pass 5 fail` → `16 pass 6 fail`, `5 pass 16 fail` → `5 pass 17 fail`;
  - not moved by this chunk, still standing: `tests/contract_ledger_probes.rs`' module doc «(all twenty-four)»,
    already pinned as the CARRY `cry-2snj2igc` on «Version done-check».

- Process hygiene: none started — every gate child ended with its entry and the control clone was removed;
  `gate.py census` (`--comm viola viola-fake-agent claude cargo-nextest --args projects/viola/target`):
  `census: 16 running`, every row another tree's or the operator's (started by NOT DERIVED), none of this run's.
